Package: guard-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Guard++ <osama.niazi347@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: nvidia-l4t-core (>= 36.4), nvidia-l4t-core (<< 36.5), libnvinfer10 (>= 10.3), libnvonnxparsers10 (>= 10.3), cuda-cudart-12-6, libopencv (>= 4.8), libsqlite3-0, libstdc++6, adduser, systemd
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Conflicts: guard
Replaces: guard
Homepage: http://127.0.0.1:8090
Description: Guard++ server for NVIDIA Jetson (AI engine + database)
 Reads license plates and recognizes drivers in gate video with TensorRT on
 the Jetson GPU, and decides whether the driver is authorized for the vehicle.
 .
 Installs the guard-inference (GPU) and guard-core (API, database) background
 services. Operators connect over the LAN (port 8090) with the Guard++ desktop
 app, or a web browser.
